# The one-argument call runs a Structure over itself and selects no `data` child (the book, call-receivers): the places
# Code declares in its data are not fields of Code itself, so the data lacks the variable the code uses -- answer 3. The
# data is passed explicitly, before the code: `call: Code\data Code`.
Code:
    data:
        int: x 1
    end: data
    x := x + 1
end: Code
call: Code
